    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "lessons learned... i dont know if i care about lessons. it just feels like a bad investment. like i put all this capital into a life and now the account is at zero. there's no way to recover that much time. what's the point of even trying to rebuild when the foundation is just empty?",
